## Acceptance Criteria (Round 1 → Round 2)

- [ ] New player completes 50 levels with undo, no timer pressure.
- [ ] Completion screen offers Challenge Round; progress saves round number.
- [ ] Round 2: undo hidden, timer active, move limit enforced.
- [ ] Levels 11–50 in Round 2: at least one shortcut-blocking mechanic active.
- [ ] All generated levels remain solvable (BFS test in CI).
